WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:22.435
"Did you hear?" Dipper asked.

2
00:00:22.436 --> 00:00:25.114
"Hear what?" Eddy asked.

3
00:00:25.115 --> 00:00:30.035
"We're having a talent show!" Dipper said.

4
00:00:30.036 --> 00:00:34.241
"I will play music in it!"

5
00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:38.803
Dipper played her music.

6
00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:52.091
She spun around and sang.

7
00:00:52.092 --> 00:00:58.261
"What will you do, Jeb?" Eddy asked.

8
00:00:58.262 --> 00:01:01.329
"Watch this!" Jeb said.

9
00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:10.097
Jeb rolled to the dirt area.

10
00:01:10.098 --> 00:01:12.988
He lifted a big rock.

11
00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:16.196
"Wow!" everyone said.

12
00:01:16.197 --> 00:01:20.891
"I will lift big things," Jeb said.

13
00:01:20.892 --> 00:01:26.104
"I can tell jokes," Poppy said.

14
00:01:26.105 --> 00:01:29.145
"And I can do balloon tricks!"

15
00:01:29.146 --> 00:01:32.467
Poppy's trunk popped open.

16
00:01:32.468 --> 00:01:36.615
Balloons floated out.

17
00:01:36.616 --> 00:01:39.127
"Cool!" Gasser said.

18
00:01:39.128 --> 00:01:42.104
"I will drive over things."

19
00:01:42.105 --> 00:01:44.839
Brumm, brumm!

20
00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:53.914
Gasser drove over a dirt pile.

21
00:01:53.915 --> 00:02:00.136
"What will you do, Eddy?" Jeb asked.

22
00:02:00.137 --> 00:02:09.118
Eddy frowned. "I don't know."
